  "content": "“Evaṃ me sutaṃ,”“Ekaṃ samayaṃ Bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ viharati Jetavane Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme.”“Atha kho Bhagavā pubbaṇhasamayaṃ nivāsetvā pattacīvaramādāya Sāvatthiyaṃ piṇḍāya pāvisi.”“Tena kho pana samaye Aggikabhāradvājassa brāhmaṇassa nivesane aggi pajjalito hoti āhuti paggahitā.”“Atha kho Bhagavā Sāvatthiyaṃ sapadānaṃ piṇḍāya caramāno yena Aggikabhāradvājassa brāhmaṇassa nivesanaṃ tenupasaṅkami.”“Addasā kho Aggikabhāradvājo brāhmaṇo Bhagavantaṃ dūratova āgacchantaṃ,”“Disvāna Bhagavantaṃ etadavoca—”“Tatreva muṇḍaka, tatreva samaṇaka, tatreva vasalaka, tiṭṭhāhīti.”“Evaṃ vutte, Bhagavā Aggikabhāradvājaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ etadavoca—”“Jānāsi pana tvaṃ, brāhmaṇa, vasalaṃ vā vasalakaraṇe vā dhamme?”“Na khvāhaṃ, bho Gotama, jānāmi vasalaṃ vā vasalakaraṇe vā dhamme.”“Sādhu me bhavaṃ Gotamo tathā dhammaṃ desetu yathāhaṃ jāneyyaṃ vasalaṃ vā vasalakaraṇe vā dhammeti.”“Tena hi, brāhmaṇa, suṇāhi,”“Sādhukaṃ manasikarohi, bhāsissāmīti.”“Evamiti kho Aggikabhāradvājo brāhmaṇo Bhagavato paccassosi.”“Bhagavā etadavoca—”“Kodhano upanāhī ca, pāpamakkhī ca yo naro.”“Vippatiṭṭhī māyāvī, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Ekajaṃ vā dijaṃ vā pi, yo idha pāṇāni hiṃsati.”“Yassa pāṇe dayā natthi, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo hanti parisaṅgāni, gāmāni nigamāni ca.”“Nigāhako samaññāto, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Gāme vā yadi vāraññe, yaṃ paresaṃ samāyitaṃ.”“Theyyā adinnamādiyati, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo have iṇamādāya, cujjamāno palāyati.”“Na hi te iṇam-atthīti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo ve kiñcikkhakkhakāmatāya, panthasmiṃ vajataṃ janaṃ.”“Hantvā kiñcikkhamādeti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo atthahetu pareheti, dhanahetu ca yo naro.”“Sakkhipuṭṭho musā brūti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo jātīnaṃ sakhānaṃ vā, dāresu patidissati.”“Sahasā sāpiyena vā, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo mātaraṃ vā pitaraṃ vā, jiṇṇakaṃ gatayobbanaṃ.”“Pahaṃsato na bharati, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo mātaraṃ vā pitaraṃ vā, bhātaraṃ bhaginiṃ sasuṃ.”“Hanati ros eti vācāya, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo atthaṃ pucchito santo, anatthamanusāsati.”“Paṭicchannaṃ manteti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo katvā pāpakaṃ kammaṃ, ‘mā maṃ jaññā’ti icchati.”“Yo paṭicchannakammanto, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo ve parakule gantvā, bhutvāna suci bhojanaṃ.”“Āgataṃ na paṭipūjeti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo brāhmaṇaṃ vā samaṇaṃ vā, aññaṃ vā pi vaṇijjakaṃ.”“Musāvādena vañceti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Yo brāhmaṇaṃ vā samaṇaṃ vā, bhattakāle upaṭṭhitaṃ.”“Roseti vācā na ca deti, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”“Asantaṃ yodha pavati, mohena paṭilīḷaggo.”“Kiñcikkhaṃ nijigiṃsāno, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.”Yo cattānaṃ samukkaṃse, paraṃ ca avajānāti.Nihīno sena mānena, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.Rosako kadariyo ca, pāpiccho maccharī saṭho.Ahiriko anoṭṭāpī, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.Rosako kadariyo ca, pāpiccho maccharī saṭho.Ahiriko anoṭṭāpī, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.Yo Buddhaṃ paribhāsati, atha vā tassa sāvakaṃ.Paribbājaṃ gahaṃ vā, taṃ jaññā vasalo iti.Yo ve anarahā santo, arahaṃ paṭijānāti.Coro sabbassa loke, esa kho vasalādhamo.Na jāti vasalo hoti.Na jaccā vasalo hoti, na jaccā hoti brāhmaṇo.Kammunā vasalo hoti, kammunā hoti brāhmaṇo.Tavam iminā pi viññeyya, yathā medaṃ nidassanaṃ.Caṇḍālaputto Sopāko, Mātaṅgo iti vissuto.So yasaṃ paramaṃ patto, Mātaṅgo yaṃ sudullabhaṃ.Ārādhayitvā khattiye ca, brāhmaṇe bahū.So devayānaṃ ārūḷha, virajaṃ so mahāpathaṃ.Kāmarāgaṃ virājetvā, brahmalokūpago ahu.Na naṃ jāti nivāresi, brahmalokūpapattiyā.Ajjhāyakā kule jātā, brāhmaṇā mantabandhuno.Te ca pāpesu kammesu, abhiṇham upadissare.Diṭṭhe va dhamme gārayhā, samparāye ca duggatiṃ.Na te jāti nivāresi, duggaccā garahāya vā.Na jaccā vasalo hoti, na jaccā hoti brāhmaṇo.Kammunā vasalo hoti, kammunā hoti brāhmaṇo.Evaṃ vutte Aggikabhāradvājo brāhmaṇo Bhagavantaṃ etadavoca—“Abhikkantaṃ bho Gotama ...”“Esāhaṃ Bhagavantaṃ Gotamaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāmi, Dhammañca bhikkhusaṅghañca.”“Upāsakaṃ maṃ bhavaṃ Gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupetaṃ saraṇaṃ gatanti.”",
